  "body": "## Reproduced; actual-merge certification pending\nThis prospectively registered campaign targets nested three-internal-vertex chains. The reviewed general lemma proves non-stacking repair when the outer target r is below its degree a: outer side leaves and U=K hold the outer profile exact while the nested subtree is normalized. It covers arbitrary a,b,c>=2 and k>=2 within r<a. General saturated-root repair and universal unit barriers remain unresolved.\n\n- Verified integrated parent: a859abae0d647daaa7167b4a98193e3d495bf3cb.\n- Immutable prospective protocol: 9c0065b62f97fab1c35439201210b8bcfe0f3c7c.\n- [Prospective coverage RED](https://github.com/proteinfoldingengine/WetLabEngine/actions/runs/36811953496), before implementation: expected omitted-representative assertion, preserved exact raw ZIP and extracted/API evidence.\n- Reviewed source: 43cf7e4ebf2cce3f0b59222cb7cdecdcfe20a5b2.\n- Publication head: d9047ea6d8425ab8044a3ac5dc55ac50b21f8935; tree7ed7ffd5039c010e330c5d0adcead077c86c7677.\n- [Science and independent fresh reproduction](https://github.com/proteinfoldingengine/WetLabEngine/actions/runs/36812516235): SUCCESS.\n-675 passing checks (600 inherited +75 new), fresh parent45 and full nested science reconstruction.\n- Nine complete graphs:233,623 states,1,575,173 edges,60 profiles,84 non-saturated canonical repairs,528 component pairs. Zero repair failures and zero nonunit pairs.\n- Saturated class separately audited:18 profiles,84 exact components,426 pairs, including342 pairs with both middle/bottom targets>=2. All tested pairs unit-connected. This is bounded evidence, not a general saturated-chain proof.\n-190 publication members verified against SHA256 manifests and Git blobs; both complete API ZIP archives retained;24 scientific files byte-identical across independent concurrent runners.\n-1,548 source/input paths retained through1,347 unique content objects, losslessly source-bound.\n\nThe primary B1/Binf/Bs remain independent scalar minima; LEX separate. Invalid candidate repair is distinguished from a complete threshold cut. Some finite cases overlap historical universes; no blind claim or physical interpretation.\n\nIndependent mathematical/source and source-artifact reviews passed. Final publication review, exact-head merge, actual-merge full replay and audited durable receipt are required before CLOSED/CERTIFIED.",
